q 0.04 0.16 0.32 rg 0 808 595 34 re f Q
BT /F2 8 Tf 1 1 1 rg 1 0 0 1 42 820 Tm (SAHAYAK | SIMPLE LANGUAGE GUIDE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 780.00 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 766.90 Tm (Thank you, Shyamantika. I will explain how SAHAYAK works.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 749.80 Tm (First, the user opens the website and allows camera access. The browser uses MediaPipe Hands to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 737.70 Tm (    find key points on the visible hands. The website turns those points into numbers and sends) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 725.60 Tm (    the numbers to the Python Flask backend. The trained model predicts a label, and the website) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 713.50 Tm (    shows that result.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 696.40 Tm (Each hand has 21 key points. Each point has x, y and z coordinates. For two hands, that gives 2 x) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 684.30 Tm (    21 x 3 = 126 values for a static pose.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 667.20 Tm (Some signs use movement over time. For those, each frame has 132 values, including hand points and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 655.10 Tm (    wrist positions. The system arranges the movement into 10 time steps, so the sequence model) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 643.00 Tm (    receives 1,320 values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 625.90 Tm (The website handles the camera preview and the drawing of hand points. The backend runs the model) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 613.80 Tm (    prediction. The current backend uses Python, Flask and scikit-learn-compatible model files) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 601.70 Tm (    saved with Joblib. The frontend is hosted on Vercel, and the backend is hosted on Render.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 584.60 Tm (The website can also have translation or speech features. Those features are separate from) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 572.50 Tm (    recognizing the sign and may need internet access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 555.40 Tm (Show: a simple diagram or the homepage. If appropriate, point to Live Studio, but leave the main) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 543.30 Tm (    live demo for Himanxhu.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 530.20 Tm (Handover: That is the path from the camera to the predicted label. Himanxhu will now demonstrate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 518.10 Tm (    the website and explain how to test it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.08 0.23 0.38 rg 1 0 0 1 42 498.00 Tm (Simple notes for Barakha) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 486.00 Tm (Static model: uses one pose input with 126 values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 472.90 Tm (Continuous model: uses a movement represented by 1,320 values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 459.80 Tm (A label file names possible classes but does not teach the model a new sign.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 446.70 Tm (Do not say the project uses TensorFlow or a CNN unless the actual code and model have been) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 434.60 Tm (    checked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 421.50 Tm (A confidence score is not a guarantee that the result is correct.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 399.40 Tm (Speaker 3 - Himanxhu V Ghimire) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.08 0.23 0.38 rg 1 0 0 1 42 379.40 Tm (Role: Live Demo, Testing and Conclusion) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 367.40 Tm (Suggested time: about 2 minutes plus demo) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 350.30 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 337.20 Tm (Thank you. I will show the current SAHAYAK prototype.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 320.10 Tm (I am opening Live Studio. The browser asks for camera permission. When the hand detector finds the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 308.00 Tm (    hand, the website can draw key points over the camera preview. The program turns those points) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 295.90 Tm (    into numbers and sends them to the backend. The model then tries to predict one of its trained) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 283.80 Tm (    labels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 266.70 Tm (I will show a sign that appears in the current model's label list. We should look at three things:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 254.60 Tm (    whether the hand is detected, whether a label appears, and whether the label matches the sign) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 242.50 Tm (    I made. One successful attempt is a demonstration, not proof of overall accuracy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 225.40 Tm (The project has limits. The model knows only a limited set of signs. Lighting, camera angle,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 213.30 Tm (    hidden hands, movement speed and similar-looking signs can cause mistakes. Full sign language) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 201.20 Tm (    also uses face movement, body position, grammar and context, which this prototype does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 189.10 Tm (    fully understand.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 172.00 Tm (Future work includes more varied labelled examples, fair testing, better moving-sign recognition,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 159.90 Tm (    clearer privacy information and feedback from people who use ISL.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 142.80 Tm (Thank you for listening. We welcome your questions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 125.70 Tm (Show: Live Studio, camera permission, hand points, one supported sign and the predicted label. If) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 113.60 Tm (    possible, try an older sign too.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 91.50 Tm (Demo checklist - before the judges arrive) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 74.50 Tm (About 10 minutes before:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 61.40 Tm (- Open the homepage and Live Studio on the device you will use.) Tj ET
q 0.78 0.82 0.87 RG 42 44 m 553 44 l S Q
