q 0.04 0.16 0.32 rg 0 808 595 34 re f Q
BT /F2 8 Tf 1 1 1 rg 1 0 0 1 42 820 Tm (SAHAYAK | SIMPLE LANGUAGE GUIDE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 780.00 Tm (- Check internet and camera permission.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 766.90 Tm (- Check the backend health and status addresses.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 753.80 Tm (- Confirm the active model labels and choose a sign on that list.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 740.70 Tm (- Test one or two signs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 727.60 Tm (- Use good lighting and keep the hands fully inside the camera view.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 714.50 Tm (- Keep a backup diagram or screenshot ready.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 697.40 Tm (During the demo:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 684.30 Tm (1. Tell the judges which sign you will try.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 671.20 Tm (2. Keep the hand visible and make the sign naturally.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 658.10 Tm (3. Wait for the result.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 645.00 Tm (4. Do not hide a wrong result or pretend a failed prediction worked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 631.90 Tm (5. Explain that translation or speech is separate from recognition.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 609.80 Tm (Backup plan if the live demo fails) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 592.80 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 579.70 Tm ("The live result depends on camera detection and the hosted backend. We have a prototype, and this) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 567.60 Tm (    shows why reliability testing matters. I can explain the steps and show the project interface) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 555.50 Tm (    while we check the connection.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 538.40 Tm (Then use the homepage or a workflow diagram. Do not claim the model worked if there was no result.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 516.30 Tm (Judge questions and simple answers) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 499.30 Tm (Q1. What is SAHAYAK?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 486.20 Tm (A: A website prototype that uses hand points and a trained model to recognize a limited set of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 474.10 Tm (    sign labels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 457.00 Tm (Q2. What problem does it explore?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 443.90 Tm (A: It explores whether technology can help show the name of a sign in situations where someone may) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 431.80 Tm (    not understand it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 414.70 Tm (Q3. Is it a complete ISL translator?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 401.60 Tm (A: No. It recognizes a limited set of trained labels. Full sign-language translation is a much) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 389.50 Tm (    bigger task.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 372.40 Tm (Q4. What is MediaPipe Hands?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 359.30 Tm (A: Software that finds key points on hands in camera frames. In this project, it runs in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 347.20 Tm (    browser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 330.10 Tm (Q5. What is a landmark?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 317.00 Tm (A: A key point on a hand, such as a finger joint or fingertip.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 299.90 Tm (Q6. Why use machine learning?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 286.80 Tm (A: It lets the program learn patterns from labelled examples and make a guess for a new example.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 269.70 Tm (Q7. Why 126 values?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 256.60 Tm (A: Two hands x 21 points per hand x three coordinates per point equals 126 numbers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 239.50 Tm (Q8. Why 1,320 values?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 226.40 Tm (A: Each movement frame has 132 values and the sequence is arranged into 10 time steps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 209.30 Tm (Q9. Which technology runs the backend?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 196.20 Tm (A: Python and Flask provide the API. The model uses scikit-learn-compatible files saved with) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 184.10 Tm (    Joblib.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 167.00 Tm (Q10. Does it recognize every ISL sign?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 153.90 Tm (A: No. It recognizes only the labels in its active trained model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 136.80 Tm (Q11. Does it work fully offline?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 123.70 Tm (A: No. Live backend prediction and some translation or speech features need internet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 106.60 Tm (Q12. How do you know its accuracy?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 93.50 Tm (A: Test with labelled examples not used during training and save the results. Do not quote a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 81.40 Tm (    number without evidence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 64.30 Tm (Q13. How will you add a sign?) Tj ET
q 0.78 0.82 0.87 RG 42 44 m 553 44 l S Q
