q 0.04 0.16 0.32 rg 0 808 595 34 re f Q
BT /F2 8 Tf 1 1 1 rg 1 0 0 1 42 820 Tm (SAHAYAK | SIMPLE LANGUAGE GUIDE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 780.00 Tm (A: Collect labelled examples, check them, train a candidate model, test it on fresh examples,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 767.90 Tm (    promote it only if acceptable, then deploy and test again.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 750.80 Tm (Q14. Is adding a name to a label file enough?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 737.70 Tm (A: No. The model needs training examples for the new sign.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 720.60 Tm (Q15. What happens when a prediction is wrong?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 707.50 Tm (A: Record the mistake, check conditions and improve the data or model. Do not hide the result.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 690.40 Tm (Q16. Can it replace an interpreter?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 677.30 Tm (A: No. It is a limited prototype and is not guaranteed to be correct.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 660.20 Tm (Q17. Why is different training data important?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 647.10 Tm (A: It helps the model face real changes between people, cameras and recording conditions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 630.00 Tm (Q18. How do you protect privacy?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 616.90 Tm (A: Ask permission before using the camera, explain what is sent or stored, and get permission) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 604.80 Tm (    before saving training samples.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 587.70 Tm (Q19. What will you improve next?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 574.60 Tm (A: Collect more balanced examples, test more people and settings, publish clear results and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 562.50 Tm (    improve weak signs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 545.40 Tm (Q20. Why call this a science project?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 532.30 Tm (A: It has a clear problem, a method that can be tested, results to check, limits to explain and a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 520.20 Tm (    plan for improvement.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 498.10 Tm (Closing reminder for every speaker) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 481.10 Tm (Be clear, use simple words and be honest. If a number has not been measured, say so. If a feature) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 469.00 Tm (    fails during the demo, explain the problem and the intended steps. Each person should speak) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 456.90 Tm (    about their own role and give credit for work done by the whole team.) Tj ET
